  <title id="root">Command reference</title>
  <status stage="doc" state="work" audience="user"/>
  <p>Every command vibe accepts, with its options, in the words the program itself prints. Nothing on this page is written by hand.</p>
  <global title="Global options">
    <p>Every command takes `--json` for machine-readable output, `--quiet` for a one-line summary, `--invoked-by &lt;agent&gt;` to stamp the caller into reports, `--unattended` to answer every confirmation, `--offline` to forbid network access, and `--agent-mode` to say how agent steps run. The full text:</p>
    <derived kind="cli-help" ref="vibe --help"/>
  </global>
